        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MS626 8-7/8 Inch Mail Slot </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass letter slot measures 8-7/8\". A complete package, this Deltana made MS626 Mail Slot comes packaged with an exterior flap, interior trim bezel for mail slot opening, and installation screws. Available in 9 different finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MS626.gif?v=1704354576\" width=\"555\" height=\"364\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MS626 Mail Door Slot Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MS626 Door Mail Slot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Hole Centers: 7-7/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Hole Centers: 2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Loaded Exterior Flap</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Del-MS626.pdf?v=1704262298\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MS626 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the mail slot door will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
